Package: koon
Title: Browser-Impersonating HTTP Client
Version: 1.0.0
URL: https://github.com/scrape-hub/koon
BugReports: https://github.com/scrape-hub/koon/issues
Authors@R: person("scrape-hub", email = "263154123+scrape-hub@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: HTTP client that impersonates real browser TLS, HTTP/2 and HTTP/3
    fingerprints. Supports Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge, Opera, Brave, Samsung
    Internet, Opera for Android, mobile browser, and OkHttp (Android app)
    profiles. Passes Akamai, Cloudflare, and other bot detection systems by
    reproducing exact browser fingerprints verified against real browser
    captures.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc >= 1.85, GNU make
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Suggests: jsonlite, knitr, processx, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0), withr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/rextendr/version: 0.5.0
Collate: 
    'extendr-wrappers.R'
    'koon.R'
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
